{4}{I am not a human any more}{I am not a human any more}{}{}{}{}
{5}{What do you mean ?}{}{1}{}{6}{}
{6}{I was born 600 years ago in a small Village near the place you call now Tarrant}{ I was born 600 years ago in a small Village near the place you call now Tarrant }{}{}{}{}
{7}{This cannot be. You are a human. Human people cannot live more that 100 years}{}{1}{wa 0}{11}{}
{8}{Why are you lying to me ?}{}{1}{wa 0}{11}{}
