{10}{Please explain what are you ?}{}{1}{}{11}{}
{11}{I was a human once. Made of flesh and blood like you. I was a farmer living happily in my house with my daughter and wife. Until they came  }{ I was a human once. Made of flesh and blood like you. I was a farmer living happily in my house with my daughter and wife. Until they came  }{}{}{}{}
{12}{Who came ?}{}{1}{wa 0}{14}{}
{13}{Please continue }{}{1}{}{14}{}
{14}{They were 3 of them all women .They drank the blood of my wife and my daughter. I tried to resist but I couldn't  .They drunk some of my blood to but I was strong .I survived }{ They were 3 of them all women .They drank the blood of my wife and my daughter. I tried to resist but I couldn't  .They drunk some of my blood to but I was strong .I survived }{}{}{18}{}
{15}{Drunk your blood ?}{}{1}{wa 0}{18}{}
{16}{Are you saying that these people were Vampires ?}{}{1}{wa 0}{18}{}
{17}{Please go on sir}{}{1}{}{18}{}
{18}{Yes. They were Vampires. After I buried my daughter and my wife I tried to hunt them down. I found a Vampire hunter  .He taught me everything about Vampires. The strengths, their weaknesses how to hunt them down and kill them}{Yes. They were Vampires. After I buried my daughter and my wife I tried to hunt them down. I found a Vampire hunter  .He taught me everything about Vampires. The strengths, their weaknesses how to hunt them down and kill them}{}{}{}{}
{19}{What are the strengths of Vampires ?}{}{1}{}{23}{}
{20}{What are the weaknesses of Vampires ?}{}{1}{}{23}{}
{21}{How you can kill a Vampire ?}{}{1}{}{23}{}
{22}{What do Vampires want ?}{}{1}{}{23}{}
{23}{Vampires want only one thing. Blood. They can survive a while with animal blood but no more than a month. After that they need to drink blood of a sentient species. Vampires  in our world are very weak at day. In day they lose fatigue rapidly and drop unconscious  .You can kill them like you can kill any critter. But at night they have incredible fatigue and health regeneration capabilities. Almost no one can kill them at night}{Vampires want only one thing. Blood. They can survive a while with animal blood but no more than a month. After that they need to drink blood of a sentient species. Vampires  in our world are very weak at day. In day they lose fatigue rapidly and drop unconscious  .You can kill them like you can kill any critter. But at night they have incredible fatigue and health regeneration capabilities. Almost none can kill them at night}{}{}{}{}
{24}{So Vampires are extremely hard to kill at night }{}{1}{}{25}{}
{25}{Yes}{Yes}{}{}{}{}
{26}{But easy to kill at day}{}{1}{}{27}{}
{27}{Yes exactly.}{ Yes exactly .}{}{}{}{}
{28}{Please go on}{}{1}{}{31}{}
{29}{Human you are alive for 600 years .Are you a Vampire ?}{}{1}{wa 0}{31}{}
{30}{So you are a Vampire .I will kill you now beast }{}{1}{wa 0}{}{co}
{31}{Yes I am. Please listen to my story. After the Vampire Hunter taught me everything he knew I started hunting Vampires. I was successful in killing a few weak ones until I finally  met the gang that had killed my family.}{Yes I am. Listen to my story. After the Vampire Hunter taught me everything he knew I started hunting Vampires. I was successful in killing a few weak ones until I finally  met the gang that had killed my family.}{}{}{}{}
{32}{And what happened next ?}{}{1}{}{33}{}
{33}{They caught me and played with me. To my great surprise instead of killing me the made me one of them. They said I was worth of the honor. Then they caught my old teacher the Vampire hunter. They left the two of us in a cell for one week.}{They caught me and played with me. To my great surprise instead of killing me the made me one of them. They said I was worth of the honor. Then they caught my old teacher the Vampire hunter. They left the two of us in a cell for one week.}{}{}{37}{}
{34}{So you killed him to drink his blood ?}{}{1}{wa 0}{37}{}
