{44}{Did you join their gang ?}{}{1}{wa 0}{45}{}
{45}{No I run away as fast as I could. I never saw anybody from the Vampire gang again. And I never will in the future.}{No I run away as fast as I could. I never saw anybody from the Vampire gang again. And I never will in the future.}{}{}{}{}
{46}{You mean that they are dead ?}{}{1}{}{49}{}
