{49}{The drunk the blood of a daughter of a great king. When the king found out he send 1000 of his best men to find the Vampires gang and kill them. The best Vampire hunter in the world trained these man. The king spared no expenses to revenge the death of his lovely daughter.}{The drunk the blood of a daughter of a great king. When the king found out he send 1000 of his best men to find the Vampires gang and kill them. The best Vampire hunter in the world trained these man. The king spared no expenses to revenge the death of his lovely daughter.}{}{}{}{}
{50}{Please go on.}{}{1}{}{51}{}
{51}{All the Vampires in that area and all the members of the Vampire gang were caught .All of them were consumed by fire .They died in terrible pain .The got what they deserved.}{All the Vampires in that area and all the members of the Vampire gang were caught .All of them were consumed by fire .They died in terrible pain .The got what they deserved.}{}{}{}{}
{52}{And what did you do to satisfy your need for blood ?}{}{1}{}{53}{}
{53}{I killed animals and drunk their blood. And every 2 months when the need for Human blood arose I tried to find the most evil person to kill}{I killed animals and drunk their blood. And every 2 months when the need for Human blood arose I tried to find the most evil person to kill}{}{}{}{}
{54}{So you killed at least 6 humans per year for 600 years. Oh my god  }{}{1}{wa 0}{57}{}
