{58}{Why ? What happened then ?}{}{1}{}{59}{}
{59}{I found this. An arcane ancient Artifact. It enables Vampires to keep all their powers but without the need to drink blood.}{I found this. An arcane ancient Artifact. It enables Vampires to keep all their powers but without the need to drink blood. }{}{}{}{}
