{63}{Such power in your hands }{}{1}{wa 0}{64}{re -20}
{64}{Yes its the same artifact that you brought back on me. And remember. At day a Vampire is extremely weak. And the artifact  does not change that. When I finally understood that they would kill my family in order to steal the artifact I tried to stop them. But I failed. Then the bastards killed them and then they hit me and left me for dead .I was ready to die until the sun finally set. In a minute I was healthy again. But they had gone. }{Yes its the same artifact that you brought back on me. And remember. A vampire has an advantage against others only at night. At day he is as weak as an ordinary human. And the artifact  does not change that. When I finally understood that they would kill my family in order to steal the artifact I tried to stall them .By afternoon I thought that they would not kill us until the dawn. But we were unlucky. One hour before the dawn they killed them. }{}{}{}{}
